==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|local maxima}}

# {{lb|en|mathematics}} A [[maximum]] within a restricted [[domain]]; a point on a [[function]] whose [[value]] is greater than the values of all other points near it, especially if another local maximum of greater value is known to exist.

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|local minimum}}
* {{l|en|global maximum}}

